# Bot1 attacks with Drudge Skeletons and Memnite; Bot2's Steel Wall blocks the Skeletons and Phyrexian Walker blocks Memnite.
# Glyph of Reincarnation can't be cast before combat or during it (CR 506.8), nor at a creature that is no Wall. In the
# postcombat main phase Bot2 casts it at its own Wall: the Skeletons are destroyed though they have a regeneration shield
# (CR 701.19c), Memnite - blocked, but not by that Wall - is not, and Bot2 puts a creature card from the graveyard of the
# player who controlled the Skeletons when the Wall blocked them (Bot1) onto the battlefield under its owner's control, not
# from its own graveyard, which holds Bot2's Memnite.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Drudge Skeletons
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Steel Wall
Phyrexian Walker
Memnite
Glyph of Reincarnation
Island
Island
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Drudge Skeletons.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Steel Wall.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
! Bot2.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Drudge Skeletons; Memnite)
Bot2.Block(Steel Wall > Drudge Skeletons; Phyrexian Walker > Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.EndCombat]
Bot1.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Drudge Skeletons.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall)
? Bot2.Mana =
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Ornithopter)
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Drudge Skeletons = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot2.Graveyard = Glyph of Reincarnation; Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 4
